<title>PHILIPPINES: PNB says 9-month 1996 net 993 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>PNB says 9-month 1996 net 993 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine National Bank posted a net income of 993 million pesos, without the extraordinary gains, in the first nine months of the year, documents submitted to the Securities and Exchange Commission said.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were available.</p>
</text>
